msgid "台灣的便利商店可以繳費、取貨、影印，也能買到很多生活用品。"
msgstr ""
"Convenience stores in Taiwan can be used for bill payment, parcel pickup, "
"printing, and buying many daily necessities."

msgid "在台灣搭捷運、公車，常會使用悠遊卡或一卡通。"
msgstr ""
"In Taiwan, people often use an EasyCard or iPASS to take the MRT and buses."

msgid "台灣很多學校都有國際事務處，可以協助境外生處理入學與生活問題。"
msgstr ""
"Many schools in Taiwan have an international affairs office that helps "
"international students with admission and daily life issues."

msgid "在台灣租屋前，建議先確認租金、押金、水電費和租約期限。"
msgstr ""
"Before renting in Taiwan, check the rent, deposit, utility fees, and lease "
"period."

msgid "台灣看醫生時，如果已加入健保，通常醫療費用會比自費便宜。"
msgstr ""
"When seeing a doctor in Taiwan, medical costs are usually lower if you are "
"enrolled in National Health Insurance."

msgid "台灣垃圾車通常會播放音樂提醒居民倒垃圾，不同地區時間不同。"
msgstr ""
"Garbage trucks in Taiwan often play music to remind residents to take out "
"trash. The schedule differs by area."

msgid "台灣夏天較熱且潮濕，外出可以準備水壺、防曬和雨具。"
msgstr ""
"Taiwan’s summers are hot and humid, so it is useful to carry water, sun "
"protection, and rain gear."

msgid "如果在台灣變更住址，部分證件或學校資料可能需要一起更新。"
msgstr ""
"If you change your address in Taiwan, some documents or school records may "
"need to be updated."

msgid "台灣校園常用 Email 或學校系統公告重要資訊，建議定期查看。"
msgstr ""
"Taiwanese schools often use email or school systems to announce important "
"information, so check them regularly."

msgid "來台後辦理手機門號時，通常需要護照、居留證或其他身分文件。"
msgstr ""
"When applying for a mobile number after arriving in Taiwan, you usually need"
" a passport, ARC, or other identity documents."

