msgid "招生簡章"
msgstr "Admission brochure"

msgid "返回資訊中心"
msgstr "Back to Info Center"

msgid "境外學生招生資訊"
msgstr "Overseas student admissions information"

msgid "本頁彙整境外學生（僑生、外籍生、交換生）來臺就讀相關招生資訊，包含各學制申請資格、招生管道、獎學金及申請時程，助您順利規劃來臺求學之路。"
msgstr ""
"This page compiles relevant admissions information for overseas students "
"(overseas students, foreign students, and exchange students) to study in "
"Taiwan, including application qualifications for each academic system, "
"admissions channels, scholarships, and application timelines to help you "
"smoothly plan your path to study in Taiwan."

msgid "多學制招生"
msgstr "Multi-study enrollment"

msgid "多國籍適用"
msgstr "Applicable to multiple nationalities"

msgid "獎學金機會"
msgstr "Scholarship Opportunities"

msgid "分期申請時程"
msgstr "Installment application timetable"

msgid "重要提醒："
msgstr "Important reminder:"

msgid "各學制招生截止日期每年均可能調整，本頁資訊僅供參考，請務必以各校最新公告或海外聯招會官網為準。"
msgstr ""
"The admission deadline for each academic system may be adjusted every year. "
"The information on this page is for reference only. Please be sure to refer "
"to the latest announcements of each school or the official website of the "
"Overseas Joint Admissions Association."

msgid "學制快速一覽"
msgstr "A quick overview of the academic system"

msgid "學制種類"
msgstr "Type of academic system"

msgid "類"
msgstr "kind"

msgid "僑先部 / 學士班 / 研究所"
msgstr "Department of Overseas Chinese/Bachelor's Program/Research Institute"

msgid "適用身份"
msgstr "Applicable status"

msgid "種"
msgstr "kind"

msgid "僑生 / 外籍生 / 交換生"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese students / foreign students / exchange students"

msgid "可申請獎學金"
msgstr "Scholarships available"

msgid "多項"
msgstr "Multiple"

msgid "教育部、學校、地方政府"
msgstr "Ministry of Education, schools, local governments"

msgid "申請截止"
msgstr "Application deadline"

msgid "約每年 3 月"
msgstr "Approximately March every year"

msgid "各管道略有差異"
msgstr "Each pipeline is slightly different"

msgid "招生學制說明"
msgstr "Admissions and Academic System Description"

msgid "僑先部（預科）"
msgstr "Department of Overseas Chinese (preparatory course)"

msgid "學士班"
msgstr "Bachelor's degree"

msgid "研究所"
msgstr "Graduate School"

msgid "外籍生"
msgstr "International Degree Student"

msgid "港澳生"
msgstr "Students from Hong Kong and Macao"

msgid "：針對僑生設立的一年制預備課程，修畢成績合格後可直升大學學士班，無需再參加大學入學考試。適合剛完成高中學業的僑生。"
msgstr ""
": A one-year preparatory course for overseas Chinese students. After passing"
" the course, they can directly enter the bachelor's degree program without "
"having to take the university entrance exam. Suitable for overseas students "
"who have just completed high school studies."

msgid "申請資格"
msgstr "Eligibility"

msgid "具僑生身份、完成相當於我國高中一至三年級學業（高中畢業），成績達一定標準。年齡通常不超過 25 歲。"
msgstr ""
"Applicants must have overseas Chinese status, have completed studies "
"equivalent to the first to third grade of high school in my country (high "
"school graduation), and have achieved certain academic standards. Usually no"
" more than 25 years old."

msgid "高中畢業"
msgstr "high school graduation"

msgid "僑生身份"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese identity"

msgid "25 歲以下"
msgstr "Under 25"

msgid "申請管道"
msgstr "Application pipeline"

msgid "透過海外聯合招生委員會（海聯會）統一分發。馬來西亞、緬甸、印尼、港澳及其他地區各有獨立招生窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Distributed uniformly through the Overseas Joint Admissions Committee "
"(Overseas Joint Admissions Committee). Malaysia, Myanmar, Indonesia, Hong "
"Kong, Macao and other regions each have independent enrollment windows."

msgid "海聯會"
msgstr "ALATS"

msgid "統一分發"
msgstr "Unified distribution"

msgid "申請時程"
msgstr "Application timetable"

msgid "通常每年 1～3 月開放網路報名，各地區截止日期略有不同。錄取結果約 5～6 月公告，8 月底至 9 月初入學報到。"
msgstr ""
"Online registration is usually open from January to March every year, and "
"the deadlines vary slightly in each region. Admission results will be "
"announced around May to June, and registration will be from the end of "
"August to the beginning of September."

msgid "1～3 月報名"
msgstr "Registration from January to March"

msgid "5～6 月放榜"
msgstr "Ranking released from May to June"

msgid "9 月入學"
msgstr "Admission in September"

msgid "獎助學金"
msgstr "Scholarships and Bursaries"

msgid "教育部提供僑生獎學金，另有各校及地方政府補助。成績優良僑生可申請教育部華語獎學金或特定區域補助。"
msgstr ""
"The Ministry of Education provides scholarships for overseas Chinese "
"students, as well as subsidies from various schools and local governments. "
"Overseas students with excellent academic performance can apply for the "
"Ministry of Education Chinese Scholarship or specific regional subsidies."

msgid "教育部獎學金"
msgstr "Ministry of Education Scholarship"

msgid "學校補助"
msgstr "school subsidies"

msgid "：四年制大學課程（部分系所五年），僑生透過海聯會申請，外籍生另有各校獨立招生管道。修業成績合格者授予學士學位。"
msgstr ""
": For four-year university courses (five years in some departments), "
"overseas students apply through the Overseas Chinese Federation, and foreign"
" students have independent admissions channels for each school. Those who "
"pass the academic examination will be awarded a bachelor's degree."

msgid "僑生申請資格"
msgstr "Application Qualifications for Overseas Chinese Students"

msgid "具僑生身份、完成高中（高級中等學校）學業成績合格，或持有同等學力證明。馬來西亞 SPM 成績、緬甸高中畢業等均可申請。"
msgstr ""
"Applicants must have overseas Chinese status and have completed high school "
"(senior secondary school) with satisfactory academic performance, or hold a "
"certificate of equivalent academic ability. Malaysian SPM results, Myanmar "
"high school graduation, etc. can apply."

msgid "海聯會管道"
msgstr "Overseas Alliance Pipeline"

msgid "同等學力"
msgstr "Equivalent academic level"

msgid "外籍生申請資格"
msgstr "Eligibility for foreign students to apply"

msgid "持外國國籍、高中（或同等）學業成績達各校最低標準。部分校系要求中文或英文能力證明（HSK、TOCFL、TOEFL、IELTS 等）。"
msgstr ""
"Hold foreign nationality and have high school (or equivalent) academic "
"performance that meets the minimum standards of each school. Some schools "
"and departments require proof of Chinese or English proficiency (HSK, TOCFL,"
" TOEFL, IELTS, etc.)."

msgid "各校獨立招生"
msgstr "Each school recruits students independently"

msgid "語言能力"
msgstr "language ability"

msgid "海聯會管道通常 1～3 月報名；各校獨立招生另有時程（多在 3～5 月）。建議提早確認目標校系公告。"
msgstr ""
"Registration for the AIS pipeline usually takes place from January to March;"
" independent admissions for each school have other schedules (mostly from "
"March to May). It is recommended to check the target school and department "
"announcement in advance."

msgid "1～3 月（海聯會）"
msgstr "January to March (Overseas Alliance)"

msgid "3～5 月（各校）"
msgstr "March to May (each school)"

msgid "教育部僑生獎學金（每月約 NT$5,000～8,000）；各校可能另有入學獎學金或成績獎助。外籍生可申請教育部臺灣獎學金。"
msgstr ""
"The Ministry of Education’s Overseas Chinese Scholarship (approximately "
"NT$5,000~8,000 per month); each school may also have entrance scholarships "
"or performance awards. Foreign students can apply for the Ministry of "
"Education Taiwan Scholarship."

msgid "臺灣獎學金"
msgstr "Taiwan Scholarship"

msgid "學校獎助"
msgstr "School scholarships"

msgid "：包含碩士班（2 年）與博士班（3～5 年），透過各校研究所獨立招生，部分學校設有英文授課專班。"
msgstr ""
": Including master's programs (2 years) and doctoral programs (3 to 5 "
"years), which are independently recruited through the research institutes of"
" each school. Some schools have special classes taught in English."

msgid "碩士班申請資格"
msgstr "Master's degree application qualifications"

msgid "大學（學士）學位畢業，成績達各校系所最低標準。部分系所要求相關領域背景或語言能力證明（中文 / 英文）。"
msgstr ""
"Graduation from a university (bachelor's) degree, with grades that meet the "
"minimum standards of each school or department. Some departments require "
"relevant field background or proof of language proficiency "
"(Chinese/English)."

msgid "學士畢業"
msgstr "Bachelor's degreeGraduation"

msgid "相關領域"
msgstr "Related fields"

msgid "博士班申請資格"
msgstr "Eligibility to apply for doctoral program"

msgid "碩士學位畢業（或同等學力），具研究潛力。通常需提交研究計畫書及相關推薦信。部分系所接受優秀碩士生直攻博士。"
msgstr ""
"Master's degree (or equivalent) with research potential. Usually, a research"
" proposal and relevant letters of recommendation are required. Some "
"departments accept outstanding master's students to study directly for Ph.D."

msgid "碩士畢業"
msgstr "Master's degree"

msgid "研究計畫"
msgstr "research project"

msgid "推薦信"
msgstr "Letter of recommendation"

msgid "各校研究所招生時程不一，多在 10 月～3 月期間。建議直接查閱目標系所官網確認截止日期及備審資料需求。"
msgstr ""
"The enrollment period for each school's graduate school varies, mostly from "
"October to March. It is recommended to directly check the official website "
"of the target department to confirm the deadline and the requirements for "
"review materials."

msgid "依各所公告"
msgstr "According to the announcement of each agency"

msgid "10 月～3 月"
msgstr "October to March"

msgid "教育部臺灣獎學金（外籍研究生）；教育部僑生獎學金（僑生）；各校研究助理（RA）薪資，及科技部研究計畫補助。"
msgstr ""
"Taiwan Scholarship from the Ministry of Education (foreign graduate "
"students); Overseas Chinese Scholarship from the Ministry of Education "
"(overseas students); salaries of research assistants (RA) in each school, "
"and research project subsidies from the Ministry of Science and Technology."

msgid "研究助理薪資"
msgstr "Research Assistant Salary"

msgid "：持外國國籍、非以僑生身份申請的學生。透過各大學獨立招生辦理，入學後須辦理外僑居留證（ARC）。"
msgstr ""
": Students with foreign nationality who are not applying as overseas "
"students. Through independent admissions procedures at each university, you "
"must apply for an Alien Residence Certificate (ARC) after admission."

msgid ""
"持外國國籍，完成相應學制的前置學歷（高中或大學畢業）。通常需提供中文（TOCFL）或英文（IELTS / TOEFL）能力證明，依各校系規定。"
msgstr ""
"Hold a foreign nationality and have completed the prerequisite education for"
" the target program (high school or university graduation). A Chinese "
"(TOCFL) or English (IELTS / TOEFL) proficiency certificate is usually "
"required, depending on each department's requirements."

msgid "外國國籍"
msgstr "foreign nationality"

msgid "前置學歷"
msgstr "Prerequisite academic qualifications"

msgid "所需備審文件"
msgstr "Required documents for review"

msgid "護照、最高學歷成績單及畢業證書（含中英文公證）、語言能力證明、個人陳述（讀書計畫）、推薦信（研究所）、體檢報告。"
msgstr ""
"Passport, highest academic transcript and graduation certificate (including "
"notarization in Chinese and English), language proficiency certificate, "
"personal statement (study plan), recommendation letter (research institute),"
" and physical examination report."

msgid "學歷公證"
msgstr "Notarization of academic qualifications"

msgid "讀書計畫"
msgstr "reading plan"

msgid "教育部臺灣獎學金"
msgstr "Ministry of Education Taiwan Scholarship"

msgid "每月生活費 NT$15,000～25,000（依學制），免學雜費，可申請 1～4 年，名額有限，需透過台灣駐外機構或各大學推薦申請。"
msgstr ""
"Monthly living expenses range from NT$15,000 to NT$25,000 (depending on the "
"academic system). Tuition and miscellaneous fees are waived. Applications "
"can be made for 1 to 4 years. Places are limited. Applications must be "
