" permanent residency application, continuous residence in Taiwan for one "
"full year (departures of up to 30 days per year permitted, no limit on "
"number of trips) or continuous residence for two years with at least 270 "
"days per year."

msgid ""
"經許可居留，在臺灣地區居留一定期間，仍具備原居留條件者（親屬關係因結婚或收養發生者，應存續三年以上。但婚姻關係存續期間已生產子女者，不在此限），得申請在臺灣地區定居。"
msgstr ""
"Those permitted to reside who have lived in Taiwan for the required period "
"and still meet the original conditions (family relationships arising from "
"marriage or adoption must have existed for at least 3 years; exception if "
"children were born during the marriage) may apply for permanent residency."

msgid ""
"經中央目的事業主管機關核准來臺就學者畢業後（HF168），依第十六條第一項第八款規定經許可居留連續滿五年，每年在臺灣地區居住一百八十三日以上，且最近一年於臺灣地區平均每月收入達中央勞動主管機關公告基本工資二倍以上者，得申請在臺灣地區定居。"
msgstr ""
"Graduates approved to study in Taiwan by the central competent authority "
"(HF168) who have resided continuously for 5 years under Article 16(1)(8), "
"resided in Taiwan for at least 183 days per year, and whose average monthly "
"income in the most recent year is at least twice the minimum wage announced "
"by the central labor authority, may apply for permanent residency."

msgid ""
"臺灣地區居留證有效期間屆滿前三十日內，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，得申請延期，每次不得逾二年；學生申請畢業延期居留者，自畢業當日起算六個月，延期居留期間屆滿前，得再申請延期一次，總延期居留期間最長為一年。（應備文件：1.申請書、2.臺灣地區居留證、3.其他相關證明文件）"
msgstr ""
"Within 30 days before ARC expiry, if the original reason for residence still"
" applies, an extension may be applied for; each extension cannot exceed 2 "
"years. Students applying for post-graduation residence extension have 6 "
"months from graduation and may apply for one further extension; total "
"extension cannot exceed 1 year. (Required: 1. Application form 2. Taiwan ARC"
" 3. Other relevant documents)"

msgid ""
"依外國人才專法第二十四條規定經許可居留，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，得申請延期居留：1.準用同法第八條規定者：每次最長為五年。2.準用同法第五條至第七條、第九條及第十條規定者：每次最長為三年。"
msgstr ""
"For those permitted to reside under Article 24 of the Act for the "
"Recruitment and Employment of Foreign Professionals, if the original reason "
"still applies, extension may be applied: 1. Under Article 8 of the same Act:"
" up to 5 years per extension. 2. Under Articles 5–7, 9, and 10: up to 3 "
"years per extension."

msgid "曾逾停留期限超過三十日未滿一年者，不予許可期間自其出境之日起算一年；逾期停留一年以上未滿二年者，起算二年；逾期停留二年以上者，起算三年。"
msgstr ""
"Those who overstayed by more than 30 days but less than 1 year are barred "
"for 1 year from departure; overstay of 1–2 years: barred 2 years; overstay "
"of 2 years or more: barred 3 years."

msgid "申請案件資料不符或欠缺者，應於書面通知送達之翌日起三個月內補正；未於規定期間補正或補正仍不合規定者，駁回其申請。"
msgstr ""
"Applicants with missing or incorrect documents must correct them within 3 "
"months of receiving written notice; failure to correct within the period or "
"correction still not meeting requirements results in rejection."

msgid "香港澳門居民以依親事由及其隨同申請之未成年子女申請在臺灣地區居留，其親屬關係因收養發生者，應存續二年以上。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau residents applying for residency based on family reunion, along "
"with minor children, must have had the family relationship through adoption "
"for at least 2 years."

msgid ""
"港澳居民逾期居留未滿三十日，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，經依相關規定處罰、繳清罰鍰後，得向本署重新申請居留；港澳居民未於居留期間屆滿前經許可延期居留，且逾期居留三十日以上者，應繳清罰款，並申請出境證出境。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau residents who overstay by less than 30 days and still meet the "
"original conditions may reapply after paying fines. Those who overstay 30 "
"days or more without an approved extension must pay fines and apply for a "
"departure permit to exit."

msgid "港澳居民依外國人才專法第二十四條規定準用同法第九條規定以網路申請平臺申請就業金卡者，相關規定請參考「外國特定專業人才申請就業金卡送件須知」。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau residents applying for an Employment Gold Card via the online "
"platform under Article 24 of the Act for Foreign Professionals should refer "
"to the \"Submission Guidelines for Foreign Special Professionals Applying "
"for an Employment Gold Card\"."

msgid "申請須知 & 相關文件下載"
msgstr "Application Notes & Document Downloads"

msgid "0902－外國人申請居留及延期居留或變更居留原因送件須知（20260116）"
msgstr ""
"0902 – Submission Guidelines for Foreign Nationals Applying for Residence, "
"Extension, or Change of Residency Purpose (20260116)"

msgid "外國人居（停）留案件申請表（20220801 版）"
msgstr "Alien Resident/Visitor Application Form (Version 20220801)"

msgid "在職證明書"
msgstr "Employment Certificate"

msgid "內政部移民署 — 居留申請說明"
msgstr "NIA — Residency Application Guide"

msgid "應備文件官方說明、辦事處查詢、線上預約、申請書下載。"
msgstr ""
"Official document requirements, office finder, online appointment booking, "
"and application form download."

msgid "在學證明申請、指定合作醫院確認、ARC 辦理協助。"
msgstr ""
"Enrollment certificate requests, designated hospital confirmation, and ARC "
"application assistance."

msgid "領取 ARC 後，持 ARC 和學校加保公文辦理加保程序。"
msgstr ""
"After receiving your ARC, complete NHI enrollment using your ARC and the "
"school's enrollment letter."

msgid "提供多語言諮詢服務，解答居留、就業、生活等問題。"
msgstr ""
"Multilingual consultation services covering residence, employment, and daily"
" life inquiries."

msgid "僑生辦理居留證服務"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese Student ARC Service"

msgid "僑生專屬服務"
msgstr "For Overseas Chinese Students"

msgid "辦理居留證（ARC）"
msgstr "Apply for ARC (Alien Resident Certificate)"

msgid "持外國護照入台就讀的僑生，必須在抵台後"
msgstr ""
"Overseas Chinese students enrolled with a foreign passport must, within"

msgid "天內"
msgstr "days of arrival,"

msgid "向內政部移民署線上辦理外僑居留證（ARC），方能在台合法居留及就讀。"
msgstr ""
"apply online for an Alien Resident Certificate (ARC) from the NIA to legally"
" reside in Taiwan and attend school."

msgid "辦理期限：入境次日起 30 天內"
msgstr "Deadline: within 30 days from the day after arrival"

msgid "規費：NT$500（僑生1年）"
msgstr "Fee: NT$500 (overseas Chinese students, 1 year)"

msgid "地點：移民署各地服務站"
msgstr "Location: NIA service stations nationwide"

msgid "請注意："
msgstr "Please note:"

msgid "持居留簽證入境次日起"
msgstr "Starting from the day after entering on a resident visa,"

msgid "，需自行至移民署線上系統辦理外僑居留證，逾期將被處罰鍰，嚴重者需出境重新申請簽證。ARC 是後續辦理加保、開戶等必要身份證明，請儘快辦理。"
msgstr ""
"you must apply for an ARC yourself via the NIA online system. Late "
"applications incur fines; serious violations may require departure and visa "
"reapplication. The ARC is essential for NHI enrollment, bank account "
"opening, and other procedures — apply promptly."

msgid "僑生1年居留證（線上繳費）"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese student 1-year ARC (online payment)"

msgid "效期時間"
msgstr "Validity Period"

msgid "1 年"
msgstr "1 year"

msgid "每年需延期"
msgstr "Must renew annually"

msgid "以下為一般應備文件，各移民署辦事處可能有細微差異。建議事前致電當地辦事處或至移民署官網確認最新版清單。"
msgstr ""
"The following are general required documents; individual NIA offices may "
"have slight variations. Call your local office or check the NIA website for "
"the latest list."

msgid "外國護照"
msgstr "Foreign Passport"

msgid "正本及影本各 1 份，效期須超過居留期間 6 個月以上。"
msgstr ""
"1 original and 1 copy; must be valid for at least 6 months beyond the "
"residence period."

msgid "入台學生簽證（居留簽）"
msgstr "Taiwan Student Visa (Resident Visa)"

msgid "持有入境台灣的學生居留簽證影本。"
msgstr "A copy of the student resident visa used to enter Taiwan."

msgid "僑生應核發的身份確認函"
msgstr "Identity Confirmation Letter for Overseas Chinese Students"

msgid "僑生還需提供僑委會或僑生應核發的身份確認文件正本及影本。"
msgstr ""
"Overseas Chinese students must also provide the original and copy of the "
"identity confirmation document issued by the OCAC or relevant authority."

msgid "在學證明書 / 清冊及通知書"
msgstr "Enrollment Certificate / Roster and Notification Letter"

msgid "由就讀學校出具的在學證明或入學許可函，需含入學日期及就讀系所。"
msgstr ""
"Enrollment certificate or admission letter from your school, including "
"enrollment date and department."

msgid "於台灣認可醫院完成之健康檢查報告，需含胸部 X 光及肺結核篩檢結果。"
msgstr ""
"Health examination report completed at a Taiwan-accredited hospital, "
"including chest X-ray and TB screening results."

msgid "近 6 個月內拍攝之 2 吋白底彩色照片（規格：寬 3.5 cm × 高 4.5 cm）。"
msgstr ""
"2-inch white-background color photo taken within the past 6 months (3.5 cm ×"
" 4.5 cm)."

msgid "外僑居留申請書"
msgstr "Alien Resident Application Form"

msgid "可於移民署官網下載或現場索取，請事先填妥基本資料。"
msgstr ""
"Download from the NIA website or obtain on-site; fill in your basic "
"information in advance."

msgid "宿舍住宿證或租屋合約書，部分辦事處或要求。"
msgstr ""
"Dormitory residence certificate or rental contract; may be required by some "
"offices."

msgid "辦理流程（Step by Step）"
msgstr "Step-by-Step Process"

msgid "全程線上辦理："
msgstr "Fully online process:"

msgid "居留證申請及延期皆以線上申辦為主。請至移民署「外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統」自行申請，"
msgstr ""
"Both ARC applications and renewals are primarily handled online. Apply "
"yourself via the NIA's \"Online Application System for Foreign and Overseas "
"Students\";"

msgid "請勿選擇「就讀學校代辦」"
msgstr "do NOT select \"Apply through your school\""

msgid "（中央大學無此服務）。"
msgstr "(NCU does not offer this service)."

msgid "外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統 ↗"
msgstr "NIA Online Application System for Foreign/Overseas Students ↗"

msgid "抵台後完成體檢並整理文件"
msgstr "Complete health check and gather documents after arrival"

msgid ""
"確認護照、入學通知函、在學證明等文件齊全。若需完成健康檢查，請至學校認可醫院辦理（國際事務處可提供名單）。非港澳生及持有效居留證的港澳生可參加校內體檢（約"
" NT$780）。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm your passport, admission letter, and enrollment certificate are "
"ready. If a health check is needed, visit a school-approved hospital (OIA "
"can provide a list). Non-HK/Macau students and HK/Macau students with a "
"valid ARC may use the on-campus health exam (approx. NT$780)."

msgid "至移民署線上系統註冊並上傳文件"
msgstr "Register and upload documents to the NIA online system"

msgid ""
"前往移民署「外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統」完成帳號註冊，掃描並上傳所需文件：近三個月 2 "
"吋彩色照片、護照、入學通知函及在學證明書。系統操作請參閱官方操作手冊。"
msgstr ""
"Go to the NIA \"Online Application System for Foreign/Overseas Students\", "
"register an account, scan and upload required documents: a 2-inch color "
"photo from the past 3 months, passport, admission letter, and enrollment "
"certificate. Refer to the official user manual for system guidance."

msgid "抵台後 30 天內"
msgstr "Within 30 days of arrival"

msgid "全程線上"
msgstr "Fully online"

msgid "繳納申請規費"
msgstr "Pay the application fee"

msgid "線上申請時繳交規費 NT$500（1 年居留證）。繳費後保存收據以備查。"
msgstr ""
"Pay NT$500 (1-year ARC) during the online application. Keep your receipt for"
" reference."

msgid "NT$500 / 年"
msgstr "NT$500 / year"

msgid "等待審核與製證"
msgstr "Wait for review and card production"

msgid "申請提交後通常需"
msgstr "After submission, production usually takes"

msgid "製卡完成（不含退補件）。可至移民署線上查詢申請進度。等待期間請保留入境章及申請收據作為合法居留的暫時證明。"
msgstr ""
"business days (excluding resubmissions). Check progress via the NIA online "
"system. Keep your entry stamp and application receipt as temporary proof of "
"legal residence during the wait."

msgid "可線上查詢進度"
msgstr "Progress trackable online"

msgid "上傳居留證至 NCU Portal"
msgstr "Upload ARC to NCU Portal"

msgid "取得居留證後，需於入學當年"
msgstr "After receiving your ARC, upload it to NCU Portal by"

msgid "月"
msgstr "month"

msgid "日前"
msgstr "of your enrollment year."

msgid "上傳至 NCU Portal（入口網站）。未準時上傳將影響校內工讀金撥款、獎學金核發及相關權益。"
msgstr ""
"Upload to NCU Portal. Failure to upload on time may affect on-campus work-"
"study pay, scholarship disbursements, and other entitlements."

msgid "9/30 前"
msgstr "Before September 30"

msgid "完成！辦理後續程序"
msgstr "Done! Complete follow-up procedures"

msgid "居留證到手後即可辦理加入健保、開設銀行帳戶、申辦手機門號等後續程序。"
msgstr ""
"Once you have your ARC, you can enroll in NHI, open a bank account, apply "
"for a mobile number, and complete other follow-up procedures."

msgid "重要注意事項"
msgstr "Important Notes"

msgid "居留證到期前"
msgstr "Before your ARC expires,"

msgid "個月內"
msgstr "month(s) in advance,"

msgid "可至移民署網站線上申請延期，規費 NT$500 / 年，核辦約 10 天。建議每學年結束前提早辦理，避免居留資格失效。"
msgstr ""
"you can apply for renewal online via the NIA website; fee NT$500/year, "
"processing about 10 days. Apply before the end of each academic year to "
"avoid lapse of residency status."

msgid "請勿選擇「就讀學校代辦」："
msgstr "Do NOT select \"Apply through your school\":"

msgid "中央大學（NCU）不提供學校代辦服務，請學生自行登入線上申辦系統辦理，勿在系統中選擇此選項。"
msgstr ""
"NCU does not offer school-assisted ARC applications. Students must log in to"
" the online system themselves and must not select this option."

msgid "居留證遺失時請立即至警局報案，持報案證明至移民署申請補發（規費 NT$500）。補發時建議隨身攜帶護照及報案證明。"
msgstr ""
"If your ARC is lost, immediately file a police report, then bring the report"
" to the NIA to apply for reissuance (fee NT$500). Carry your passport and "
"police report when applying."

msgid "我是台灣的僑生（台灣護照）的僑生也需要辦居留證嗎？"
msgstr ""
"I am an overseas Chinese student with a Taiwan passport — do I still need an"
" ARC?"

msgid ""
"不需要。持中華民國籍由僑居地（台灣護照）入台的僑生，具有完整公民身份，無需辦理居留證。本頁服務適用於持外國護照入台就讀的僑生（海外永久居民等）。"
msgstr ""
"No. Overseas Chinese students who enter Taiwan with ROC citizenship (Taiwan "
"passport) have full citizen status and do not need an ARC. This page is for "
"overseas Chinese students who enter Taiwan with a foreign passport "
"(permanent residents abroad, etc.)."

msgid "健康檢查可以在抵台後才做嗎？"
msgstr "Can I do the health check after arriving in Taiwan?"

msgid ""
"可以。可於抵台後參加校內體檢（約 NT$780），或至學校指定醫院完成。注意檢查報告出爐需數天，請盡早安排以避免超過 30 "
"天辦理期限。建議抵台後隔天即至國際事務處詢問體檢安排。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. You can take the on-campus health exam (approx. NT$780) or go to a "
"school-designated hospital after arriving. Note that results take a few days"
" — arrange it early to stay within the 30-day deadline. Visit the OIA the "
"day after arrival to ask about exam arrangements."

msgid "居留證辦理期間可以在台灣合法居留嗎？"
msgstr ""
"Can I legally stay in Taiwan while my ARC application is being processed?"

msgid "可以。申請提交後至居留證核發前，持入境章及申請收據即可作為合法居留證明。建議隨身攜帶此兩份文件，以備需要時出示。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. After submitting your application and before the ARC is issued, your "
"entry stamp and application receipt serve as proof of legal residence. Carry"
" both documents at all times in case you need to present them."

msgid "可以在不同縣市的移民署辦事處辦理嗎？"
msgstr "Can I apply at an NIA office in a different city or county?"

msgid "可以。全台各縣市均設有移民署服務站，選擇距離學校最近的辦事處即可。但建議選擇學校所在縣市的辦事處，方便日後延期和處理相關事務。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. NIA service stations are available in all cities and counties. Choose "
"the office closest to your school. However, it is recommended to use the "
"office in the same county or city as your school for easier renewal and "
"related matters."

msgid "畢業後若要繼續留台，居留資格如何處理？"
msgstr ""
"What should I do about residency status if I want to stay in Taiwan after "
"graduation?"

msgid ""
"在學期間以「就讀」為居留事由。畢業後如需繼續留台（例如找工作），需在畢業後 30 "
"天內申請變更居留事由為「工作」或「其他」，或在找到合法工作並取得工作許可後辦理變更為「工作」居留事由。建議畢業前盡早規劃，避免居留證失效。"
msgstr ""
"During study, the residency purpose is \"study\". After graduation, if you "
"want to stay (e.g., to find work), apply to change the residency purpose to "
"\"work\" or \"other\" within 30 days of graduation, or after finding legal "
"employment and obtaining a work permit. Plan ahead before graduation to "
"avoid ARC expiration."

msgid "外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統"
msgstr "NIA Online Application System for Foreign/Overseas Students"

msgid "居留證線上申請入口，需自行註冊帳號並上傳文件。"
msgstr ""
"Online ARC application portal; register an account yourself and upload "
"documents."

msgid "辦事處查詢、線上預約、申請進度查詢、外僑居留申請書下載。"
msgstr ""
"Office finder, online appointment, application progress tracking, and "
"application form download."

msgid "僑務委員會（OCAC）"
msgstr "Overseas Community Affairs Council (OCAC)"

msgid "僑生身份確認函申請、僑生相關權益說明、海外服務諮詢。"
msgstr ""
"Apply for the overseas Chinese student identity confirmation letter, learn "
"about entitlements, and consult overseas services."

msgid "學校國際事務處"
msgstr "School Office of International Affairs (OIA)"

msgid "諮詢在學證明申請、指定合作醫院、移民署辦理協助等服務。"
msgstr ""
"Consult on enrollment certificate requests, designated hospital list, and "
"NIA application assistance."

msgid "提供多語言諮詢，包含居留、就業、生活等問題解答。"
msgstr ""
"Multilingual consultation covering residence, employment, and daily life."

msgid "在台開設銀行帳戶"
msgstr ""

msgid "領獎學金・生活必備"
msgstr "Collect scholarships · Daily essentials"

msgid "在台留學期間，銀行帳戶是領取獎學金、支付租金與日常消費的基本工具。本頁整理開戶銀行選擇與流程說明。"
msgstr ""
"During your studies in Taiwan, a bank account is essential for receiving "
"scholarships, paying rent, and daily spending. This page covers bank options"
" and the account-opening process."

msgid "推薦銀行選擇"
msgstr "Recommended Banks"

msgid "中華郵政（郵局）"
msgstr "Chunghwa Post (Post Office)"

msgid "外籍生首選"
msgstr "Top pick for international students"

msgid "全台門市最廣，外籍生開戶最友善，"
msgstr ""
"Widest branch network in Taiwan, most foreigner-friendly for account opening"
" — "

msgid "當日即可拿到存摺與提款卡"
msgstr "passbook and ATM card on the same day"

