msgstr "Enrolled through the employer as the insuring unit"

msgid "※ 短期性工作未逾 3 個月者，可選擇以原投保資格繼續投保"
msgstr ""
"※ Those working short-term (under 3 months) may choose to continue "
"enrollment under their original insured category"

msgid "「在臺居留滿 6 個月」認定方式"
msgstr "How to count '6 months of residence in Taiwan'"

msgid ""
"指進入臺灣地區連續居住達 6 個月，或曾出境 1 次且未逾 30 日，實際居住期間扣除出境日數後，併計達 6 個月。若出境超過 1 次，或出境一次超過 "
"30 天，則從重新抵台當天起算，6 個月重新計算。"
msgstr ""
"This means continuously residing in Taiwan for 6 months, or having departed "
"once for no more than 30 days, with the actual residence period minus "
"departure days totaling 6 months. If you depart more than once, or depart "
"once for over 30 days, the 6-month count restarts from the day you return to"
" Taiwan."

msgid "計算範例："
msgstr "Calculation example:"

msgid "入境日：113/9/1 → 未曾出境 → 投保日：114/3/1"
msgstr "Entry date: 113/9/1 → No departures → Enrollment date: 114/3/1"

msgid "入境日：113/9/1 → 曾出境 1 次（114/1/1–1/5，共 4 天）→ 投保日：114/3/5"
msgstr ""
"Entry date: 113/9/1 → Departed once (114/1/1–1/5, 4 days total) → Enrollment"
" date: 114/3/5"

msgid "在臺參加健保注意事項"
msgstr "Notes on NHI enrollment in Taiwan"

msgid "僑外生在臺就學並符合投保資格期間，應以就讀學校為投保單位辦理投保。"
msgstr ""
"Overseas/foreign students studying in Taiwan who meet the eligibility "
"requirements must enroll in NHI through their school as the insuring unit."

msgid "僑外生經許可在臺工作並受僱，投保單位（雇主）應於被保險人合於投保資格之日起 3 日內，向健保署辦理投保。"
msgstr ""
"When overseas/foreign students are permitted to work in Taiwan and are "
"employed, the insuring unit (employer) must complete NHI enrollment within 3"
" days of the insured becoming eligible."

msgid "於受僱單位投保時，應先至學校辦理轉出，避免重複投保。"
msgstr ""
"When enrolling through an employer, first arrange a transfer-out from the "
"school to avoid duplicate enrollment."

msgid "與工作單位終止僱傭關係後，應另以適法身分投保：若已受新單位聘僱，於新單位投保；未受聘僱期間則應回學校辦理投保。"
msgstr ""
"After ending employment, enroll under another eligible status: if hired by a"
" new employer, enroll through the new employer; during periods without "
"employment, return to school enrollment."

msgid "符合投保資格且無工作期間，若配偶、父母或子女在臺已為健保被保險人，應以眷屬身分依附其投保單位加保。"
msgstr ""
"During eligible but unemployed periods, if a spouse, parent, or child in "
"Taiwan is already an NHI insured, you should enroll as a dependent under "
"their insuring unit."

