msgid ""
"符合清寒資格加入健保者，可向國際事務處申請每月 NT$413 補助（需檢附清寒證明，審查通過後核發）。未得補助者每月保費約 "
"NT$826。詳情請洽國際事務處。"
msgstr ""
"Those who qualify as low-income and enroll in NHI may apply to the OIA for a"
" monthly subsidy of NT$413 (requires proof of low-income status; granted "
"after review). Without the subsidy, the monthly premium is approx. NT$826. "
"Contact the OIA for details."

