msgstr ""
"Taiwan uses a tiered healthcare system. For common illnesses, visit a clinic"
" first (family medicine or internal medicine) — the co-pay is only about "
"NT$150. Going directly to a hospital emergency room or outpatient department"
" requires a higher co-pay (NT$240–480)."

