#~ msgid ""
#~ "「僑生」是指具有中華民國國籍或華裔血統、長期居住海外並在當地接受教育者，依教育部規定認定，可享僑生獎學金及僑先部等特別管道。「外籍生」則是持非中華民國國籍護照入學者，通常透過各校獨立招生管道申請，可申請教育部臺灣獎學金。兩者身份認定不同，適用的招生管道與優惠也不同。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"Overseas compatriot students\" (僑生) refers to those with ROC citizenship "
#~ "or Chinese ancestry who have lived abroad long-term and received education "
#~ "there, as recognized by the Ministry of Education. They may access special "
#~ "channels such as overseas compatriot scholarships and preparatory programs. "
#~ "\"International students\" (外籍生) refers to those entering with a non-ROC "
#~ "passport, typically applying through each university's independent "
#~ "international admissions process and eligible for the Ministry of Education "
#~ "Taiwan Scholarship. The two statuses are recognized differently, with "
#~ "different admissions channels and benefits."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "不可以。海聯會管道僅適用於具僑生身份的申請者。外籍生（持外國國籍但不符僑生認定）須直接向各大學的國際招生辦公室申請，各校招生時程與文件要求請見各校官網。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "No. The OCAC channel is only available to applicants with overseas "
#~ "compatriot student status. International students (those holding a foreign "
#~ "passport but not recognized as overseas compatriot students) must apply "
#~ "directly to each university's international admissions office. Please visit "
#~ "the respective university websites for application timelines and document "
#~ "requirements."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "各系所對中文能力要求不同。部分系所設有最低中文檢定門檻（如 TOCFL B1 "
#~ "以上），部分則接受入學後修讀中文語言課程作為補強。建議查閱目標系所的最新招生簡章確認，或聯繫學校國際事務處詢問。若中文尚未達標，也可先考慮申請全英語授課的系所或語言先修課程。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Chinese proficiency requirements vary by department. Some departments set a "
#~ "minimum Chinese proficiency threshold (e.g., TOCFL B1 or above), while "
#~ "others accept enrollment in Chinese language courses after admission as a "
#~ "supplement. We recommend checking the latest admission guidelines for your "
#~ "target department or contacting the school's Office of International "
#~ "Affairs. If your Chinese is not yet up to standard, you may also consider "
#~ "applying to English-taught programs or language preparatory courses."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "海聯會管道可填寫多個志願（學校 + "
#~ "系所），系統依志願序分發，通常一個申請可含多個志願。外籍生透過各校獨立申請時，只要在截止期限前分別向各校提交申請即可，但需留意各校的申請費及文件要求可能不同。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The OCAC channel allows you to fill in multiple preferences (school + "
#~ "department), and the system assigns placements based on preference order — "
#~ "one application typically covers multiple choices. For international "
#~ "students applying to individual schools, simply submit separate applications"
#~ " to each school before their respective deadlines, but note that application"
#~ " fees and document requirements may differ between schools."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "教育部臺灣獎學金需在入學申請時或入學後另行提出申請，通常透過台灣駐外機構或直接向學校申請，名額有限，競爭較激烈。僑生獎學金部分由海聯會或學校自動審核，部分需額外填寫申請表。學校自設的入學獎助學金通常在錄取通知中會一併說明。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The Ministry of Education Taiwan Scholarship must be applied for separately,"
#~ " either at the time of admission or after enrollment, typically through "
#~ "Taiwan overseas representative offices or directly through the school. Slots"
#~ " are limited and competition is strong. Overseas compatriot scholarships are"
#~ " partly reviewed automatically by OCAC or the school, and partly require a "
#~ "separate application form. School-specific admission scholarships are "
#~ "usually explained in the admission offer letter."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "可以，但需注意轉學申請通常有年級限制（多限大二、大三），且需提供原校成績單及放棄學籍證明。各校轉學招生時程不一，通常在每學年結束前後辦理，詳情請查閱目標校系的轉學考簡章。研究所學生轉所需依各所規定辦理。"
#~ msgstr ""
